        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia Privacy Push Pin</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nReplacement privacy locking pin for use with <a href=\"/collections/omnia-levers\"><b>Omnia door lever sets</b></a>,  <a href=\"/collections/omnia-knobs\"><b>Omnia door knob sets</b></a>,  <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Collection</b></a> and <a href=\"/collections/omnia-stainless-steel-levers\"><b>Omnia stainless steel levers</b></a>.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n35 mm (standard length), 3mm x .50 thread push pin screws into a Privacy function (Bed or Bathroom) door latch. Available in 7 finishes. Also Available <a href=\"/products/omnia-extension-for-privacy-pin\"><b>Extension for Privacy Pin for 2 - 2-1/4 inch thick doors</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Warning:</b> These work for knobs and levers manufactured by Omnia only. If you are not sure if your hardware was manufactured by Omnia, do NOT order these as they may not work properly. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually - NO RETURNS</b>\r\n</p>",
